# game/case06.rpy:60
translate schinese press_meiling_1_b012b978:

    # you "How brief was this rest?"
    you "这次休息有多“短”？"

# game/case06.rpy:62
translate schinese press_meiling_1_b48d2a9d:

    # meiling "Two hours. For a youkai, that's barely a blink."
    meiling "两个小时。对妖怪来说只是眨一下眼。"

# game/case06.rpy:66
translate schinese press_meiling_2_374cf47c:

    # you "Did you hear anything while you rested?"
    you "你休息时听到什么了吗？"

# game/case06.rpy:67
translate schinese press_meiling_2_f252d076:

    # meiling "Birds. The breeze. Someone humming. Ordinary gate sounds."
    meiling "鸟叫。微风。有人在哼歌。门口的寻常声音。"

# game/case06.rpy:69
translate schinese press_meiling_2_f2256740:

    # eiki "Humming."
    eiki "哼歌。"

# game/case06.rpy:73
translate schinese press_meiling_3_1147c1f1:

    # you "Never? How can you be so sure?"
    you "“从来不”？你凭什么这么肯定？"

# game/case06.rpy:75
translate schinese press_meiling_3_afee21f4:

    # meiling "Because I've seen how thieves get in! Write this down."
    meiling "因为我见过小偷是怎么进来的！记下来。"

# game/case06.rpy:76
translate schinese press_meiling_3_2c276c8f:

    # meiling "Put it in my testimony. Exactly as I say it."
    meiling "把这句加进我的证词。一字不差。"

# game/case06.rpy:80
translate schinese press_meiling_4_921f7cc1:

    # you "How many thieves have you actually seen break in?"
    you "你亲眼见过几个小偷闯进来？"

# game/case06.rpy:81
translate schinese press_meiling_4_8cb8634d:

    # meiling "One. Marisa. But she was very thorough about it."
    meiling "一个。魔理沙。不过她闯得非常彻底。"

# game/case06.rpy:83
translate schinese press_meiling_4_f5d9c7bb:

    # eiki "One thief, and from her a law for every thief alive."
    eiki "只凭一个小偷，就定下了天下所有小偷的规律。"

# game/case06.rpy:94
translate schinese case6_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "肃静。彼岸逻辑法庭现在开庭。"

# game/case06.rpy:96
translate schinese case6_79e913f8:

    # komachi "Back on the bench, boss?"
    komachi "又回到审判席了，四季大人？"

# game/case06.rpy:97
translate schinese case6_20fb4d4c:

    # eiki "Where I belong. Komachi, the defendant?"
    eiki "这才是我的位置。小町，被告呢？"

# game/case06.rpy:98
translate schinese case6_e390f340:

    # komachi "Awake, boss. I checked twice."
    komachi "醒着呢，四季大人。我确认了两次。"

# game/case06.rpy:99
translate schinese case6_9228cb8e:

    # eiki "A first. Bring her in."
    eiki "破天荒头一回。带她进来。"

# game/case06.rpy:102
translate schinese case6_8fbabe28:

    # meiling "Hong Meiling, gatekeeper of the Scarlet Devil Mansion. I was awake. Mostly."
    meiling "红魔馆门卫，红美铃。我是醒着的。大部分时间。"

# game/case06.rpy:105
translate schinese case6_0cb71a97:

    # eiki "The charge: napping at the gate while a thief walked off with the mistress's parasol."
    eiki "罪名：在门口打瞌睡，让小偷拿走了大小姐的阳伞。"

# game/case06.rpy:108
translate schinese case6_c0829d26:

    # meiling "Nobody gets past my gate. Everyone knows that."
    meiling "没人能通过我守的门。人人都知道。"

# game/case06.rpy:112
translate schinese case6_c290c673:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. One example is a story. It is not a rule."
    eiki "见习法官。一个例子只是一个故事，不是规律。"

# game/case06.rpy:113
translate schinese case6_ee742e20:

    # eiki "Watch for a witness who turns one story into everyone's."
    eiki "留意那种把一个故事说成所有人故事的证人。"

# game/case06.rpy:129
translate schinese case6_133293e7:

    # meiling_t "Yesterday at noon I rested my eyes. Briefly. My mind stayed on duty."
    meiling_t "昨天中午我闭目养神了一会儿。脑子一直在站岗。"

# game/case06.rpy:130
translate schinese case6_810fb915:

    # meiling_t "While I was resting, the mistress's parasol vanished from the hall."
    meiling_t "我休息的时候，大小姐的阳伞从大厅里不见了。"

# game/case06.rpy:131
translate schinese case6_082ce7fe:

    # meiling_t "But the thief didn't come through my gate. Thieves never do."
    meiling_t "但小偷没有走我的门。小偷从来不走门。"

# game/case06.rpy:135
translate schinese case6_ecebe65b:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. Try to keep her awake."
    eiki "证人交给你了，见习法官。尽量别让她睡着。"

# game/case06.rpy:149
translate schinese case6_cross_d0b360e4:

    # eiki "Again. Komachi, nudge the witness."
    eiki "再来一次。小町，戳一下证人。"

# game/case06.rpy:160
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_f69410cc:

    # you "One break-in through one window doesn't tell us how every thief gets in."
    you "一次从窗户闯入，说明不了所有小偷都怎么进来。"

# game/case06.rpy:161
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_6c29c608:

    # you "These geta prints come straight through your front gate. Someone walked right past you."
    you "这些木屐印直接穿过你的正门。有人就从你身边走了过去。"

# game/case06.rpy:164
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_53a93a4b:

    # meiling "...Tengu sandals. I'd know them anywhere. I usually see them while I'm asleep."
    meiling "……天狗的木屐。我一眼就认得。我通常是睡着时看到的。"

# game/case06.rpy:168
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_800bfca1:

    # eiki "A hasty generalization. One example, stretched into a law."
    eiki "以偏概全。把一个例子硬拉成一条规律。"

# game/case06.rpy:169
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_d8ef543d:

    # eiki "One swallow does not make a summer. One window does not make every thief."
    eiki "一燕不成夏。一扇窗也代表不了所有小偷。"

# game/case06.rpy:176
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_416ad574:

    # eiki "Defendant Hong Meiling. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告红美铃。本庭判决你……"

# game/case06.rpy:187
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_749f0955:

    # eiki "Sentence: one week at the gate. Awake. Komachi will check on you."
    eiki "判决：看门一周。醒着看。小町会来查岗。"

# game/case06.rpy:188
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_0add5145:

    # komachi "Me? Boss, I'm the court's leading expert on naps."
    komachi "我？四季大人，我可是本庭头号的午睡专家。"

# game/case06.rpy:189
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_31efee77:

    # eiki "Exactly. It takes one to know one."
    eiki "正因如此。内行才看得出门道。"

# game/case06.rpy:192
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_a7e8ba32:

    # meiling "And the parasol?"
    meiling "那阳伞呢？"

# game/case06.rpy:195
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_d6d2bac3:

    # eiki "The note is signed \"A.S.\" A certain reporter will be hearing from this court."
    eiki "字条署名是“A.S.”。某位记者很快会收到本庭的传唤。"

# game/case06.rpy:196
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_6063f5e0:

    # eiki "Bailiff."
    eiki "法警。"

# game/case06.rpy:197
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "这就去，四季大人。"

# game/case06.rpy:209
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_1f137532:

    # eiki "Over the wall. Of course."
    eiki "翻墙走了。果然。"

# game/case06.rpy:210
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_478325d5:

    # komachi "Gatekeepers never use gates, boss. Everyone knows that."
    komachi "门卫从来不走门，四季大人。人人都知道。"

# game/case06.rpy:211
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_12fd63d6:

    # eiki "Komachi, that is exactly the fallacy we just..."
    eiki "小町，这恰恰就是我们刚刚……"

# game/case06.rpy:212
translate schinese case6_breakthrough_a37b3ced:

    # eiki "Never mind. Court is adjourned."
    eiki "算了。退庭。"

translate schinese strings:

    # game/case06.rpy:10
    old "Library Window"
    new "图书馆的窗户"

    # game/case06.rpy:10
    old "Replaced after Marisa's last visit. Locked from the inside. Not a scratch on it."
    new "魔理沙上次来访后换过。从里面锁着。毫无刮痕。"

    # game/case06.rpy:12
    old "Footprints at the Gate"
    new "门口的脚印"

    # game/case06.rpy:12
    old "Tengu geta prints, from the front gate straight to the hall. Muddy. Fresh."
    new "天狗木屐印，从正门直通大厅。沾着泥，很新。"

    # game/case06.rpy:14
    old "Note on the Parasol Stand"
    new "伞架上的字条"

    # game/case06.rpy:14
    old "\"Borrowed for a photo shoot. Back soon! —A.S.\""
    new "“借去拍照，马上还！——A.S.”"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "The Window Theory"
    new "窗户理论"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Yesterday at noon I rested my eyes. Briefly. My mind stayed on duty."
    new "昨天中午我闭目养神了一会儿。脑子一直在站岗。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "A nap is a confession, not a fallacy. Find where she reasons."
    new "打盹是招供，不是谬误。找出她推理的地方。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "While I was resting, the mistress's parasol vanished from the hall."
    new "我休息的时候，大小姐的阳伞从大厅里不见了。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "That is simply what happened. Look for where she draws a conclusion."
    new "这只是发生过的事。找她下结论的地方。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "But the thief didn't come through my gate. Thieves never do."
    new "但小偷没有走我的门。小偷从来不走门。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "\"Never\" is a big word. Press her on it before you object."
    new "“从来不”可是个大词。反对之前先追问她。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Marisa broke in through the library window. So every thief uses the windows!"
    new "魔理沙是从图书馆窗户闯进来的。所以小偷都走窗户！"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "She isn't saying one event caused another. She's building a rule out of one example."
    new "她没说一件事导致了另一件事。她是在用一个例子造规律。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "No chain of disasters here. Just one break-in, stretched over every thief alive."
    new "这里没有灾难连锁。只是把一次闯入套到了所有小偷身上。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Nobody is offering two doors. Count how many thieves her rule is built on."
    new "没人只给两扇门。数数她的规律建立在几个小偷身上。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "She isn't attacking anyone. She's turning one burglar into all of them."
    new "她没攻击任何人。她是把一个窃贼变成了所有窃贼。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "She isn't excusing herself with Marisa's sins. She's using Marisa as a sample of one."
    new "她不是拿魔理沙的过错为自己开脱。她是把魔理沙当成了唯一的样本。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "No famous name here. Just one memory doing the work of a survey."
    new "这里没有大人物。只是拿一段记忆充当调查。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Her conclusion isn't hiding in her reason. Her reason is simply far too small."
    new "她的结论没藏在理由里。只是理由太小了。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "That doesn't show how this thief got in. Find out which way they came."
    new "这证明不了这个小偷是怎么进来的。查清对方从哪边来的。"

